 "frontmatter": {
  "title": "August 2024 - npx shadcn init",
  "description": "Complete CLI rewrite with support for all major React frameworks.",
  "date": "2024-08-31T00:00:00.000Z"
 },
 "toc": [
  {
   "depth": 3,
   "url": "#update-your-project",
   "title": "Update Your Project"
  }
 ],
 "hast": "\n<p>The new CLI is now available. It's a complete rewrite with a lot of new features and improvements. You can now install components, themes, hooks, utils and more using <code>npx shadcn add</code>.</p>\n<p>This is a major step towards distributing code that you and your LLMs can access and use.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>First up, the CLI now has support for all major React frameworks out of the box. Next.js, Remix, Vite and Laravel. And when you init into a new app, we update your existing Tailwind files instead of overriding.</li>\n<li>A component now ships its own dependencies. Take the accordion for example, it can define its Tailwind keyframes. When you add it to your project, we'll update your tailwind.config.ts file accordingly.</li>\n<li>You can also install remote components using url. <code>npx shadcn add https://acme.com/registry/navbar.json</code>.</li>\n<li>We have also improved the init command. It does framework detection and can even init a brand new Next.js app in one command. <code>npx shadcn init</code>.</li>\n<li>We have created a new schema that you can use to ship your own component registry. And since it has support for urls, you can even use it to distribute private components.</li>\n<li>And a few more updates like better error handling and monorepo support.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>You can try the new cli today.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn init sidebar-01 login-01\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn init sidebar-01 login-01\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn init sidebar-01 login-01\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn init sidebar-01 login-01\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn init sidebar-01 login-01\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> sidebar-01</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> login-01</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"update-your-project\">Update Your Project</h3>\n<p>To update an existing project to use the new CLI, update your <code>components.json</code> file to include import aliases for your <strong>components</strong>, <strong>utils</strong>, <strong>ui</strong>, <strong>lib</strong> and <strong>hooks</strong>.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;$schema&#x22;: &#x22;https://ui.shadcn.com/schema.json&#x22;,\n  &#x22;style&#x22;: &#x22;new-york&#x22;,\n  &#x22;tailwind&#x22;: {\n    // ...\n  },\n  &#x22;aliases&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;components&#x22;: &#x22;@/components&#x22;,\n    &#x22;utils&#x22;: &#x22;@/lib/utils&#x22;,\n    &#x22;ui&#x22;: &#x22;@/components/ui&#x22;,\n    &#x22;lib&#x22;: &#x22;@/lib&#x22;,\n    &#x22;hooks&#x22;: &#x22;@/hooks&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"style\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"new-york\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"tailwind\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#8B8B8B94;--shiki-light:#6E7781\">    // ...</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  },</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"aliases\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"components\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"@/components\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"utils\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"@/lib/utils\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"ui\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"@/components/ui\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"lib\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"@/lib\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"hooks\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"@/hooks\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>If you're using a different import alias prefix, e.g. <code>~</code>, replace <code>@</code> with your prefix.</p>"
}
